00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,397
Module 3 covers Pre-Screen Preparation.

2
00:00:03,397 --> 00:00:06,823
Our sales team never goes into a call blind.

3
00:00:06,823 --> 00:00:13,514
Before the meeting, the representative opens 'Tiny', our custom Claude A I Project.

4
00:00:13,514 --> 00:00:27,735
They paste the Mega-Prompt template and provide the required inputs: Kevin's intake form, his exported LinkedIn profile PDF, and the historical Statement of Work pulled from the Google Drive repository.

5
00:00:27,735 --> 00:00:34,970
Within sixty seconds, Tiny digests these inputs and generates a structured ten-point briefing.

6
00:00:34,970 --> 00:00:48,455
This dossier highlights Meridian's likely technical pain points, maps the competitors they are evaluating, and provides three tailored conversation starters to use immediately when the call connects.

